  "geometry": "Four advert fronts retain their simple backing and thickness; CHERV retains its source58V/34T body. FREE8/9/10 use the original22V/14T cone,20V/10T post and seven42V/32T signs, including their UVs and material slots. Exact member CRC gates apply only to track2. Nodes, transforms, sectors, controllers and contact data remain unchanged.",
  "uv_contract": {
    "replacement": "Replace each original BMP through its exact name, size and CRC32. No UV remap, additional slot or game texture. Reused images retain their bytes.",
    "signs": "Preserve complete number/PIT glyphs and original arrow paths. LARROW4 and LARROW2 share artwork with distinct source UV directions. The LDHL support/rear crop U45/63..61/63,V0..7/15 (rectangles) or8/15 (arrows) remains white.",
    "chevron": "Four repeat periods; middle-row white strokes at x5..9,21..25,37..41,53..57 of64. Preserve clipped top/bottom phase. SNAPON support faces sample the plain lower margin at V.77422..90324.",
    "TH12BOX2": "Preserve the square plaster/panel/recess atlas and852 exact source black-key pixels. Upper plaster ends at U.125; dark panel ends at U.609375. CHERV samples the dark panel at U.15872..42856,V.12701..23811. The same image serves TH12BOX_1 and two TV01_1 bindings; their other materials remain open.",
    "cone": "Source band boundaries at V.34375/.65625/.8125; square foot, taper and corner UVs retained."
  },
  "export": "Three new images generated from original references. Wide-chart crops remove excess vertical margins to retain source glyph proportions; the whole chart is resized with Lanczos to source aspect, maximum512px. WebP quality70/method6. Restore exact nearest-scaled source black-key alpha. TH12BOX2 has852 transparent source pixels; the other14 images are opaque. Twelve reused images retain their existing encoding and provenance.",
